    "backed": "An in-repo evidence file states it.",
    "partial": "Evidence covers part of the claim; the note says which part is missing.",
    "conflict": "Evidence sources disagree with the page or with each other.",
    "unbacked": "No in-repo evidence. May still be true; the owner must supply a source or reword.",
